Added the ``blocks`` setting to enable, disable and configure each Volto block type: ``blocks={"codeBlock": {"style": "light"}, "slateTable": False}`` in ``html_to_blocks()``, ``markdown_to_blocks()`` and ``volto_blocks()``, ``--enable``, ``--disable`` and ``--option`` in the ``convert`` command, and a ``blocks`` field on ``POST /html``, ``POST /markdown`` and ``POST /volto``. Each block type now names the frontend package that provides it, and the new ``html2blocks blocks`` command, the ``GET /blocks`` endpoint and the "Supported blocks" documentation page list them all with their default state and options. @ericof
